CAP_HEIGHT 4
RAW_ASCENT 818
RAW_DESCENT 181
NORM_SPACE 5
RELATIVE_WEIGHT 50
RELATIVE_SETWIDTH 50
FIGURE_WIDTH 5
AVG_LOWERCASE_WIDTH 50
AVG_UPPERCASE_WIDTH 50
